  "feedbacks": {
    "data": [
      {
        "eventAttended": "@Devfest'22",
        "feedbackDescription": "A year ago, if I had been told that I'd be attending #devfest2022 in my first sem itself, I would have had a good laugh about it. But somehow, manifestation worked out! Had an amazing weekend learning insight sessions from Big Brains like Mr. Senthilkumar Murugesan, Mr. Kazi Haque, Ms. Jyoti Mishra, Rohan Prasad, Mr. Kamesh Sampath, Mr. Rishabh Gupta about FlutterFlow, Kubernetes Architect, Google Cloud, Kotlin Koins, Anthos, Drone CI, etc.",
        "feedbackTitle": "Somehow, manifestation worked out!",
        "name": "Aditya Gurung"
      },
      {
        "eventAttended": "@Devfest'22",
        "feedbackDescription": "Flutter or Android App Development was never something I took much interest in, until today, where I was in a session with Bhavik Makwana and Dhrumil Shah. They made it look so easy and interesting. Definitely going to explore more on this! Thank You so much GDG Siliguri to let us have a wonderful experience. It was an awesome experience to attend DevFest this year!",
        "feedbackTitle": "It was an awesome experience to attend DevFest this year!",
        "name": "Trisha Senapati"
      },
      {
        "eventAttended": "@Devfest'22",
        "feedbackDescription": "I attended DevFest2022 Siliguri for the very first time and the experience was great. Thanks GDG Siliguri for giving us such a great and an amazing event. We got a chance to learn so many new things from our amazing speakers Bhavik Makwana Dhrumil Shah Anubhav Singh Jyoti Mishra Abhishek Nandy Rohan Prasad Kazi Haque Rishabh Gupta. Looking forward for more upcoming events.",
        "feedbackTitle": "A great and an amazing event",
        "name": "Shreyasi Talukdar"
      },
      {
        "eventAttended": "@Devfest'19",
        "feedbackDescription": "GDG Siliguri has organised the innovative Google DevFest events at SIT where every bits was enjoyable, informative and the energy from both side of Speaker, Organizer Audience have made the GDG more Masala-dar. I have enjoyed lot and gain many knowledge for my core area of industry.",
        "feedbackTitle": "Attended the most innovative and informative events from the Window of Mt Kanchenjunga!",
        "name": "Eishan Chattaraj"
      },
      {
        "eventAttended": "@Devfest'19",
        "feedbackDescription": "Got to learn a lot from the amazing speakers. I had a lot of fun interacting with other like minded developers from the region and participating in the hackathon! Eagerly waiting for the next Devfest!",
        "feedbackTitle": "Awesome Experience!",
        "name": "Sahil Saha"
      }
    ],
    "enabled": true
  },
